QuestGuidance.Register("en",133,{
[4225]="70052B20\n1\tPrune bedeviled roots at Tríubad (total: 14)\tBedeviled roots can be found throughout Tríubad. You have encountered some of the bedeviled roots the Woodmen described in their tales, and you should prune them before they overtake Tríubad.\n2\tCompleted\tYou pruned many of the bedeviled roots at Tríubad.\n",
[4226]="7004185F\n1\tTalk to the captured Corsair captain\030Talk to the captured Corsair archer\030Talk to the captured Haradrim warrior\tThe jail of Ost Anglebed can be found to the south-east of the entrance to the Lord's Hall. Nimithil has asked you to speak to prisoners in an attempt to uncover the source of the treachery in Ost Anglebed.\n2\tTell Steward Malthellim of the prisoners' warnings\tSteward Malthellim can be found in the Lord's Hall in Ost Anglebed. You have spoken to the prisoners and should now tell Steward Malthellim of what you have learned.\n3\tTalk to Nimithil\tNimithil can be found in the lowest section of Ost Anglebed with her guards. You have spoken to the prisoners in Ost Anglebed and relayed your findings to Malthellim. You should now return to Nimithil.\n",
[4227]="7004A8FD\n1\tMercifully defeat hollowing Orcs at Kála-murg (total: 8)\tHollowing Orcs can be found throughout Kála-murg in Rath Cail. You have heard the pleas of an Orc doomed to death by \"the hollowing\" to spare others like him a terrible fate. You should mercifully defeat any hollowing Orcs you encounter in Kála-murg.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have mercifully defeated many of the hollowing Orcs at Kála-murg.\n",
[4228]="7006136F\n1\tAsk about Adamanda's whereabouts\tHobbits who may know where Adamanda is can found around Nobottle and Long Cleeve. You should ask if anyone knows where Adamanda North-took is.\n2\tFind Adamanda North-took\tAdamanda North-took can be found in Yondershire. You should look for Adamanda North-took.\n",
[4229]="70061399\n1\tTalk to Anson Roper\tAnson Roper can be found in Tighfield. Adamanda North-took has asked you to collect some rope from Anson Roper.\n2\tCollect flax (total: 6)\tFlax can be found growing in the farms of northern Tighfield. Anson Roper has asked you to collect flax.\n3\tBring the flax to Anson\tAnson Roper can be found in Tighfield. You should bring the flax to Anson Roper.\n4\tCollect a fine piece of wood\tFallen wood can be found in the forests around Tighfield. Anson Roper has asked you to collect a fine piece of fallen wood.\n5\tBring the wood to Anson\tAnson Roper can be found in Tighfield. You should bring the fine piece of wood to Anson.\n6\tPick up the rope\tThe rope is next to Anson in Tighfield. You should pick up the rope.\n7\tReturn to Adamanda\tAdamanda is near Nobottle. You should bring the rope to Adamanda.\n",
[4230]="70069448\n1\tCraft a crate of jewellery for the Umbar Jeweller's Guild\tThe recipe needed to complete this quest is available for purchase. Purchase the quest recipe from the guild leader. Create a crate of jewellery for Umbar Baharbêl.\n2\tDeliver a crate of jewellery to the Umbar Jeweller's Guild Leader\tProvide the crate of jewellery to the Umbar Jeweller's Guild Leader.\n",
