[4244]="70067F76\n1\tSpeak with Hûzo to travel to Jid Phêsi\tTo the east of Rhakatâb on the southern slope of the mountains there is a mining cave that suffered a cave-in. Go there and rescue the miners trapped behind the rubble.\n2\tReturn to Hûzo at the common in Rakhatâb\tThe miners are safe, and you escaped the mine. Return to Hûzo and tell him that the mine is either unsafe or home to something that will make it unsafe for his miners to continue working there.\n",
[4245]="70058514\n1\tTalk to Aighrig\tRékkur has suggested bringing Aighrig with you to the Orc camp. Aighrig stands before the stairs to Annâk-khurfu.\n2\tUse war horn and defeat Uflúk\030Use the whistle to summon Aighrig to your side\tThe Orc camp Zarkul-sulûn is located west of Annâk-khurfu. Aighrig believes that Uflúk can be lured out if you find a war horn to use in the camp.\n3\tShow Aighrig the report\030Use the whistle to summon Aighrig to your side\tUpon defeating Uflúk, you found a report among his belongings. Discussing this report with Aighrig may reveal something.\n4\tDeliver the report to Rékkur\tRékkur awaits your return at Annâk-khurfu, to the east of Zarkul-sulûn. Aighrig has asked you to bring the report to him.\n",
[4246]="7003570F\n1\tCollect firewood (total: 8)\tFirewood can be found around clusters of trees in the northern High Knolls. You should collect firewood so that the women can comfortably settle into their new temporary home.\n2\tCéolflad is in the refugees' cave in northern Byre Tor. You should bring the firewood to Céolflad.\t\n",
[4247]="70071CCA\n1\tRetrieve flowers from outside Zajâna (total: 8)\tRetrieve the flowers from outside Zajâna that the Pohâni Têredal mentioned.\n2\tReturn to the Pohâni Têredal in the Kalmakhíla in Zajâna\tReturn to the Pohâni Têredal in the Kalmakhíla in Zajâna.\n3\tCreate raised beds for the flowers within the Kalmakhíla (total: 8)\tCreate raised beds for the flowers in the flower bed within the Kalmakhíla in Zajâna.\n4\tPlant the harvested flowers within the Kalmakhíla (total: 8)\tPlant the harvested flowers in the holes you've dug within the Kalmakhíla in Zajâna.\n5\tGather water from the bucket near the planted flowers\tGather water from the bucket near the planted flowers in the Kalmakhíla in Zajâna.\n6\tWater the planted flowers in the flower bed (total: 8)\tWater the planted flowers in the flower bed within the Kalmakhíla in Zajâna.\n7\tReturn to the Pohâni Têredal in the Kalmakhíla\tReturn to the Pohâni Têredal in the Kalmakhíla and report on your success.\n",
[4248]="70016B9C\n1\tDefeat Orcs at the Fallen Ice (total: 8)\tThe Orcs are digging at the Fallen Ice, north-west of Mekhem-bizru. Raskwith asked you to stop the Orcs who are attempting to dig through the avalanche at the Fallen Ice.\n2\tTalk to Raskwith at Mekhem-bizru\tRaskwith is at Mekhem-bizru, south-east of the Fallen Ice. Raskwith will be pleased to hear the Orcs' efforts have been disrupted.\n",
[4249]="7003E2F0\n1\tDig at the mounds\tThe strange mounds of earth can be found north of Mincham's Camp, in the Fields of Fornost. You should dig at the strange piles of earth.\n2\tDig at mounds (total: 6)\tThe strange mounds of earth can be found north of Mincham's Camp, in the Fields of Fornost. You should dig at the strange piles of earth.\n3\tCompleted\tThe digging was dangerous work in disturbed and sullied earth, but you uncovered some valuables just the same. You are richer for your troubles.\n",
[4250]="700033FF\n1\tFind Taradan's barrow\030Find Orron's barrow\030Find Ringdor's barrow\tThe barrows of Taradan, Orron, and Ringdor lie in the northern Barrow-downs. Tobold Leafcutter has told you that you should dig at the entrances to the barrows of Taradan, Orron, and Ringdor. To help in your digging, he has given you a blunted pick-axe to use. This tool will help prevent any damage the digging may cause to any lore-fragments you uncover.\n2\tBring the lore-fragments to Tobold Leafcutter\tTobold Leafcutter waits for you between the Barrow-downs and the Old Forest. Your digging at the barrows of Taradan, Orron and Ringdor has uncovered three fragments of lore, written on scraps of parchment. You should bring these fragments to Tobold Leafcutter.\n",
[4251]="7006B6C2\n1\tDefeat Ordâkhai (total: 6)\tNingêna has asked you to go to Khetsok, the Ordâkhai camp on the south side of the Wrackwade in Ambarûl, and defeat some of the soldiers there.\n2\tTalk to Ningêna\tYou have defeated Ordâkhai soldiers at Khetsok, the Ordâkhai camp on the south side of the Wrackwade. You should return to Ningêna at Sûru.\n",
[4252]="7002729D\n1\tDefeat elhudan at the Slade of Shadows (total: 5)\tElhudan may be found within the Slade of Shadows, south of Andreg's position. Andreg has instructed you to defeat elhudan at the Slade of Shadows.\n",
[4253]="70027810\n1\tDestroy buckets of tar (total: 6)\tBuckets of tar can be found around the watch-tower in Trum Dreng. You should destroy buckets of tar so that it cannot be used to make flaming arrows.\n2\tReturn to Elain at the watch-tower\tElain can be found on the path by the watch-tower in Trum Dreng. You should tell Elain that you have destroyed the tar that was meant to be brought to the top of the tower.\n",
[4254]="7004CE21\n1\tTalk to Frekur\030Talk to Orgrand\030Talk to Rikolf\030Talk to Maeriel\030Talk to Hoskuld\tFrekur, Orgrand, Rikolf, Maeriel, and Hoskuld can be found in Lake-town. You should talk to Frekur, Orgrand, Rikolf, Maeriel, and Hoskuld.\n2\tTalk to Dagrun\tDagrun is waiting for you near the Master's manor. You should talk to Dagrun.\n3\tComplete: The Deadly Dinner\tDagrun is waiting for you near the Master's manor. You should talk to Dagrun.\n4\tTalk to Dagrun\tDagrun can be found in the Master's manor. You should talk to Dagrun.\n",
[4255]="70060FAF\n1\tTalk to Griffo Boffin inside 8 Honeymead Lane\030Talk to Esmeralda Boffin inside 8 Honeymead Lane\030Talk to Marigold Boffin inside 8 Honeymead Lane\tGriffo, Esmeralda, and Marigold have all gone inside 8 Honeymead Lane. Dinodas, frantic with worry, has tasked you with scattering his siblings to the wind in order to delay the opening of Angelica's house-warming present.\n2\tTalk to Prisca Boffin inside 8 Honeymead Lane\tPrisca has a question for you. She is currently inside 8 Honeymead Lane, waiting for the house-warming party to begin.\n3\tTalk to Angelica Boffin inside 8 Honeymead Lane\tAngelica is suddenly distraught! She stands inside her new home, 8 Honeymead Lane, but has been upset by something.\n4\tGo outside and see if Angelica's siblings plan to come right back\tAngelica has asked you to go outside and find out if her siblings plan to come right back for her party.\n5\tTell the nosey hobbits not to bother Dinodas (0/3)\tDinodas is being pestered by nosey hobbits of Yondershire.\n6\tTell the nosey hobbits not to bother Dinodas (1/3)\tDinodas is being pestered by nosey hobbits of Yondershire.\n7\tTell the nosey hobbits not to bother Dinodas (2/3)\tDinodas is being pestered by nosey hobbits of Yondershire.\n8\tMake sure the nosey hobbits leave Dinodas alone\tThe nosey hobbits leave... for now.\n9\tTalk to Dinodas Boffin on Honeymead Lane\tDinodas is grateful that you got the nosey hobbits to leave him alone.\n",
[4256]="7005AB03\n1\tTalk to Hórin outside the main keep of Thyrstáth and go with him to conduct some diplomacy\tHórin is standing by outside the main keep of Thyrstáth. You should talk to Hórin and engage in some dwarf-diplomacy by completing 'Instance: The Giant's Den.'\n2\tTalk to Hórin inside the keep of Thyrstáth\tYou and Hórin have found a hiding spot in a storage area in Thyrstáth. You should talk to Hórin.\n3\tComplete 'Frost-horde Allies' for Hórin\030Complete 'Treasures of the Ancient Dwarves' for Hórin\030Complete 'Gifts of Persuasion' for Hórin\tThe ice-giants have allied themselves with the Frost-horde, and must be persuaded otherwise... by force if necessary. You should complete objectives in Thyrstáth with Hórin.\n4\tCall Hórin and talk to him\tYou have disrupted the enemy forces in Thyrstáth. You should talk to Hórin.\n5\tTalk to Klúso west of Bazan-medan\030(Optional) Talk to Hórin to quickly return to Klúso\tYou have done what you can to disrupt the ice-giants in Thyrstáth. You should return to Klúso near Bazan-medan.\n6\tCall Hórin and talk to him\tHórin can be called to your side with the summoning horn. You should talk to Hórin.\n",
})
